                                "sense_id": "0be50eb6-aa22-359b-b7e4-37286140c069",
                                "text": "1829, Edgar Allan Poe, “Al Aaraaf” in James Hannay (ed.), The Poetical Works of Edgar Allan Poe, London\" Charles Griffin, 1852, p. 164,\n[…] my pennoned spirit leapt aloft,"
